# toll_tracking.func

> Module: toll_tracking (HGS Geçiş Takibi) | Category: FLEET

## Purpose
HGS (Hızlı Geçiş Sistemi) toll pass tracking for Turkish highways and bridges. Record each toll crossing with entry/exit gates, fee amount, and vehicle. Added in v2.34.

## Problems It Solves
- Turkish highways and bridges use HGS electronic toll collection
- Fleet owners need to audit toll charges against vehicle movements
- Toll costs are a significant operating expense
- Cross-reference toll records with trip logs for expense verification

## Technical Database Structure
**Table:** `toll_logs`
| Column | Type | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| id | SERIAL PK | Unique identifier |
| tenant_id | INTEGER FK | Tenant isolation |
| arac_id | INTEGER FK | Linked to trucks.id |
| giris_gise | VARCHAR(100) | Entry toll gate name |
| cikis_gise | VARCHAR(100) | Exit toll gate name |
| gecis_ucreti | DECIMAL(12,2) | Toll fee amount |
| gecis_tarihi | TIMESTAMPTZ | Passage date/time |
| hgs_etiket_no | VARCHAR(50) | HGS tag number |
| created_at, updated_at | TIMESTAMPTZ | Timestamps |

## User Interface
**TollLogsPage.tsx** — `/dashboard/toll-logs`
- DataGrid table: Araç, Giriş Gişe, Çıkış Gişe, Geçiş Ücreti, Tarih, HGS No
- Add/Edit modal with truck selector + gate fields
- Delete with confirmation

## API Endpoints
| Method | Path | Auth | Description |
|--------|------|:---:|-------------|
| GET | `/api/tenant/toll-logs/` | Tenant JWT | List toll records |
| POST | `/api/tenant/toll-logs/` | Tenant JWT | Add record |
| PUT | `/api/tenant/toll-logs/{id}` | Tenant JWT | Edit record |
| DELETE | `/api/tenant/toll-logs/{id}` | Tenant JWT | Remove record |

